      "Title": "CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.Noise.Axis3D",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"reference/CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.Noise.Axis3D.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Which local axes a noise or shake channel drives. Combinable, so a channel can drive any subset.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
