      "Title": "CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.Presets.PresetAsset<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"reference/CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.Presets.PresetAsset-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Wraps one preset data type as a Unity asset. Unity's own asset serialization persists\n<xref href=\"CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.Presets.PresetAsset%601.Data\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> natively; no code here is needed for that. Text-based save/load — sharing a\npreset outside the project — is a separate concern handled by\n<code>CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad</code>, not by this class.</p>\n"
    },
