      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.DefaultSaveSystem",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"reference/CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.DefaultSaveSystem.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">The default <xref href=\"CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.ISaveSystem\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> composition: JSON text over plain files. Convenience for\nthe common case; build a <xref href=\"CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.SaveSystem\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> directly when a different serializer or file\nI/O is needed instead.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "reference/CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.IFileIO.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
