      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.SaveSystem",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"reference/CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.SaveSystem.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Default <xref href=\"CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.ISaveSystem\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. Wraps expected I/O and format failures into a Result rather\nthan throwing, so callers never need a try/catch around Save or Load. Exceptions outside that\nexpected set — eg a bug in a custom <xref href=\"CodeSmile.AnyMotion.Core.SaveLoad.ITextSerializer\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> — still propagate, because\nthose are programming errors, not the external-input failures this exists to handle.</p>\n"
    },
